<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for today was estimated at $8.11 per cwt live, down 0.07 when compared to Wednesday's value. - USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S. TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT VALUE</p>
<p>(STEER) -			   Lbs   Price  Change   Value</p>
<p>Steer hide, butt brand	 4.92   74.50   -1.00    4.70</p>
<p>Tallow, edible		   1.20   19.75   -1.00    0.24</p>
<p>Tallow, packer bleachable    4.50   19.00    -	 0.86</p>
<p>Tongues, Swiss #1 Wht 0-3%   0.26  125.00    -	 0.33</p>
<p>Cheek meat, trmd		 0.32   68.75    -	 0.22</p>
<p>Head meat			  0.13   52.50    -	 0.07</p>
<p>Oxtail, selected		 0.16  136.00    -	 0.22</p>
<p>Hearts, reg, bone out	  0.38   26.00    -	 0.10</p>
<p>Lips, unscalded		  0.11   50.00    -	 0.06</p>
<p>Livers, slcted, gall off     0.96   37.00    -	 0.36</p>
<p>Tripe, scalded edible	  0.65   26.00    -	 0.17</p>
<p>Tripe, honeycomb bleached    0.15   45.00    -	 0.07</p>
<p>Lungs, inedible		  0.47    4.60    -	 0.02</p>
<p>Melts				0.14    6.25    -	 0.01</p>
<p>Meat bone ml, 50% blk/ton    3.70  274.00   -1.50    0.51</p>
<p>Blood meal, 85% blk/ton	0.60  575.00    -	 0.17</p>
<p>TOTAL :			   18.65			  8.11</p>
<p>The average value of hide and offal for the four days ending Thursday, July 3, 1997 was estimated at 8.14 per cwt., down -0.08 from last week and down -0.45 from last year. ((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
